- Meta Model
    Entity
        Node
            Dependency
                Independent Node
                Dependent Node
                    independent node
            Tree (Recurring Tree)
                Parent
                Child
                    tree
            Star (Flat Tree)
                Root
                Peripheral
                    root
                Remote
                    first peripheral
                    second peripheral
                    node (control)
            ...
        Edge
            Directional Edge
                from node
                to node
            Non Directional Edge (Many To Many Dependency)
                first node
                second node
    Record
        attribute: value
